docs:KrasnaTabletka
Abilities and Personal Lives

limitations. It is worth noting that this does require training before it can be perfected. Common abilities that KrasnaTabletkas possess while plugged into the VectOr are unnatural speed, strength, agility, jumping exceedingly far, and other enhanced attributes that seem to defy the laws of physics. KrasnaTabletkas also have access to certain resources, such as skills that have been downloaded into their minds or weapons and equipment generated by a real-world operator. However, no KrasnaTabletka (save the One) has ever been able to match an Shpion in combat.
